--TEST--
the `///` run the parser attached to a declaration is what hovering a name that resolves to it answers, as Markdown with the markers off, `rule:tooling/doc-comment-is-three-slashes`
--FILE--
<?nvs
/// One person, as the store holds them.
///
/// The name is what a greeting is built from, and it is never null.
class User
{
    public string $name = "";
}

var $u = new Us<|>er();
echo $u->name;
--REQUEST--
hover
--EXPECT--
One person, as the store holds them.

The name is what a greeting is built from, and it is never null.
